{"id":"n49221-2-7","stage":3,"title":"세대 · 代","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49221-2-7-1","ko":"후배들이 나를 따돌리는 거 같아.","zh":"后辈们好像在排挤我。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"후배들이","meaning":"学弟，学妹，师弟，师妹，后辈","explanation":"후배：学弟，学妹，师弟，师妹，后辈；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"후배","audio":"/audio/d1877a494d990fd1bd03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73247","senseId":"2","lemma":"후배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후배들이","audio":"/audio/4c634acc23b737fa7959.mp3"}},{"text":"나를","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나를","audio":"/audio/4225b1c78642e45b4068.mp3"}},{"text":"따돌리는","meaning":"排挤，排斥","explanation":"따돌리다：排挤，排斥；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"따돌리다","audio":"/audio/e0797dc793d0a1e8e4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49650","senseId":"1","lemma":"따돌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따돌리는","audio":"/audio/4151b9a341beb24dcd9d.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d1877a494d990fd1","term":"후배","zh":"学弟，学妹，师弟，师妹，后辈","audio":"/audio/d1877a494d990fd1bd03.mp3","entryId":"73247","definition":"同一学校内比自己入学晚的人。","pronunciation":["후ː배"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"e0797dc793d0a1e8","term":"따돌리다","zh":"排挤，排斥","audio":"/audio/e0797dc793d0a1e8e4a4.mp3","entryId":"49650","definition":"远离或欺负怨恨或讨厌的人。","pronunciation":["따돌리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3b817991b23403b08e31.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49221-2-7-2","ko":"세대가 다르면 어울리기 힘들 수 있지.","zh":"不同世代的人可能不太容易融到一起。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"세대가","meaning":"代，一代","explanation":"세대：代，一代；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"세대","audio":"/audio/f8550bf54c82de933bff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49221","senseId":"2","lemma":"세대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세대가","audio":"/audio/71a7e1ab269c606d59ea.mp3"}},{"text":"다르면","meaning":"不同，不一致","explanation":"다르다：不同，不一致；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"1","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다르면","audio":"/audio/5271fcfdc385da1d336d.mp3"}},{"text":"어울리기","meaning":"打成一片","explanation":"어울리다：打成一片；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"어울리다","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67048","senseId":"2","lemma":"어울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어울리기","audio":"/audio/d9a6c0ec84fe7dbb8ff7.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들","meaning":"难，困难，费劲，难以","explanation":"힘들다：难，困难，费劲，难以；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"2","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들","audio":"/audio/00855e55295b70cc2d1d.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있지.","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있지","audio":"/audio/6af127780f763fcd960b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f8550bf54c82de93","term":"세대","zh":"代，一代","audio":"/audio/f8550bf54c82de933bff.mp3","entryId":"49221","definition":"生活在同一时代、有着共同想法的相似年龄层；或指那些人。","pronunciation":["세ː대"]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"不同，不一致","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"两个对象相互不一样。","pronunciation":["다르다"]},{"id":"e3eff4fbd4afe320","term":"어울리다","zh":"打成一片","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3","entryId":"67048","definition":"一起很好地相处，或加入某个群体一同活动。","pronunciation":["어울리다"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"难，困难，费劲，难以","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"做某事不简单或不容易。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/018154a9ef4d2211e38d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.942,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/Search